The following lists all {{pkmn|Egg}}s in {{g|GO}}, grouped based on their respective hatching distances. 

==List of Eggs==
{{outdated}}
This list uses data collected by TheSilphRoad<ref>[https://thesilphroad.com/egg-distances TheSilphRoad Egg Distance Chart]</ref>.

Eggs for region-exclusive Pokémon can only be obtained at [[PokéStop]]s or {{OBP|Gym|GO}}s within their respective regions. 7 km Eggs can only be obtained as gifts from friends. In addition, by hitting milestones with [[Adventure Sync]], players can earn special 5 km or 10 km Eggs by walking a total of 25 km or 50 km, respectively, in a week. 12 km Eggs, also known as Strange Eggs, can only be obtained after winning a {{OBP|Trainer Battle|GO|battle}} with a {{tc|Team GO Rocket Leader}}<ref>[https://pokemongo.nianticlabs.com/en/post/autumn-event-2020-strange-eggs/ What are these Strange Eggs? Save them from Team GO Rocket during the autumn event!]</ref>. Players can earn also special 7 km Eggs from [[Mateo]]'s daily gifts at the end of a {{GO|Route}}.

